  <item>
    <title>EP2. 足球与我们的成长（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64e6ca983fa4090b741cccd6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64e6ca983fa4090b741cccd6</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Aug 2023 03:12:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>八蛋 （B站@Bogdan_八蛋）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>一儒</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这是本节目的第二期，也是和一儒接着上一期没聊完的话题继续聊，分享一些我们成长中看球的经历和一些有的没的想法。本来想雨露均沾地涵盖到我们这些年所看的各种比赛，但是两个巴萨球迷大部分时间还是在聊这些年的巴萨。想想巴萨刚刚又欧冠小组出局，全是泪啊:(</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年又是世界杯年，也希望能有一届精彩的世界杯可以看吧。后续可能会录几期世界杯的专题节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> 南非世界杯之后开始认真看球</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">05:17</a> 10-11赛季开始好好关注巴萨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="483">08:03</a> 关于2012年欧洲杯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="626">10:26</a> 那些年我们爱过的梦三巴萨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="854">14:14</a> 2014世界杯（这时间点好巧合，和14过不去了）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1252">20:52</a> 一些关于裁判判罚尺度的杂谈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1775">29:35</a> 2014世界杯后，巴萨的MSN时代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">34:45</a> 乱入的一些足坛花边新闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2168">36:08</a> 我们这个年代的意甲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a> MSN 时代要结束了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">38:25</a> 聊聊那场<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">6:1</a></span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2455">40:55</a> 内马尔的2.2亿带来的足坛各种转会费飙升</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2622">43:42</a> 内马尔走后的巴萨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3308">55:08</a> 聊聊武磊在西甲的表现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3465">57:45</a> 科曼&amp;哈维时期的巴萨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3946">01:05:46</a> 2016年欧洲杯的记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4165">01:09:25</a> 2018世界杯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4486">01:14:46</a> 展望2022世界杯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4700">01:18:20</a> 结尾</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：原创音乐</span></p>]]></description>
